                        </StackPanel>
                    </StackPanel>
                    <StackPanel Visibility="{variable:Clip5:Collapsed}">
                        <TextBlock TextWrapping="Wrap" Margin="0,0,0,4" FontWeight="Bold"
                                   Text="1. 铁链" />
                        <TextBlock TextWrapping="Wrap" Margin="0,0,0,4"
                                   Text="铁链的模型实际使用了灯笼的顶部纹理。" />
                        <TextBlock TextWrapping="Wrap" Margin="0,0,0,4" FontWeight="Bold"
                                   Text="2. 鸡骑士" />
                        <TextBlock TextWrapping="Wrap" Margin="0,0,0,4"
                                   Text="生成为鸡骑士的幼年尸壳和幼年僵尸猪灵（下界传送门生成的除外）所骑乘的鸡一定是热带鸡，因为其只会在热带生物群系生成。" />
                        <TextBlock TextWrapping="Wrap" Margin="0,0,0,4" FontWeight="Bold"
                                   Text="3. 钥匙（3D Shareware v1.34）" />
